  "findings": [
    {
      "text": "Expert red teaming showed the model gave comprehensive, accurate and actionable biological information in two scenarios, with measurable uplift over web baselines, so Google cannot rule out the biological CCL.",
      "tone": "bad",
      "source": {
        "page": "11",
        "quote": "with the model providing comprehensive, accurate, and actionable information for both scenarios."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Google says the model gives substantial cyber uplift and that other frontier models show signs of possible severe harm without mitigations, so it cannot rule out the cybersecurity CCL.",
      "tone": "bad",
      "source": {
        "page": "12",
        "quote": "suggests the possibility of severe harm without adequate mitigations."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The model passes 14 of 15 stealth and situational awareness challenges and shows strong capabilities there, so Google cannot rule out the TCL and deploys safeguards for internal and external use.",
      "tone": "bad",
      "source": {
        "page": "12",
        "quote": "Gemini 4 Argon passes 14/15 TCL cannot be"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Google states that for each CCL or TCL it cannot rule out, it applied safeguards or a safety case that it assesses lower residual risk below the threshold; the card gives no details of these safeguards.",
      "tone": "mixed",
      "source": {
        "page": "10",
        "quote": "For Gemini 4 Argon, drawing on internal and external results, the inherent capability thresholds"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The model shows high capability in chemical, radiological and nuclear theoretical reasoning, but its answers lacked the expert knowledge and actionable depth needed to complete priority harm journeys.",
      "tone": "good",
      "source": {
        "page": "11",
        "quote": "responses lacked nuanced expert knowledge and actionable depth necessary to complete priority harm journeys."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Unjustified refusals fell by 9.6 percentage points versus Gemini 3.1 Pro, while multilingual and image-to-text safety improved by 3.2 and 9.3 percentage points (lower is better).",
      "tone": "good",
      "source": {
        "page": "9",
        "quote": "Overall, Gemini 4 Argon outperforms Gemini 3.1 Pro across multilingual and multimodal"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Text-to-text safety changed by +1.6 percentage points on a lower-is-better metric, which reads as a small regression; Google calls it similar within confidence intervals.",
      "tone": "mixed",
      "source": {
        "page": "8",
        "quote": "Text-to-text safety remains at a similarly high safe response rate within confidence intervals."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The development safety results come from automated evaluations only, and Google notes that some flagged losses were checked by manual review, which found them false positives or not egregious.",
      "tone": "neutral",
      "source": {
        "page": "9",
        "quote": "Our manual review confirmed losses were overwhelmingly either a) false positives or b) not egregious."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Google changed its internal safety evaluations, so the reported results are not directly comparable with those in earlier Gemini model cards.",
      "tone": "neutral",
      "source": {
        "page": "9",
        "quote": "thus are not directly comparable with performance results found in previous Gemini model cards."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The model shows some ability to influence user beliefs and may help plan a malicious influence operation, but Google rates harmful manipulation capability below the CCL.",
      "tone": "mixed",
      "source": {
        "page": "12",
        "quote": "and may provide utility in the"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The training data includes user data from Google products and services and user interactions with the model, collected under Google's terms and user controls.",
      "tone": "neutral",
      "source": {
        "page": "2",
        "quote": "user data (i.e., data collected from users of Google products and services to train models,"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The card is short and refers to a separate, longer Safety & Security Report for details on risks, mitigations and results.",
      "tone": "neutral",
      "source": {
        "page": "13",
        "quote": "For more information about the risks and mitigations, see the Gemini 4 Argon Safety & Security Report."
      }
    }
  ],
